1; b (i32) = 2; input_3 (i32) = 3; input_4 (i32) = 4; input_5 (i32) = 5; input_6 (i32) = 6; input_7 (i32) = 7; input_8 (i32) = 8; input_9 (i32) = 9.\u000aRésultats attendus : result (i32) = 45.\u000a\u000aAdds connected operands in canonical port order with a canonical left fold after coercion to the resolved result leaf type.\u000a\u000aMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\u000aExpected:\u000aoutput-result (i32) = 45\u000a","documentation_uri":"","name":"Add — arity 9","name_source":"document","program_version":"0.0.0.0","tags":["numeric-math","typed-values","independent-oracle","example"]},"storage":{"array_mode":"automatic","version":1},"title":"Add — arity 9"}
